      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your feelings of despair do not make the \"meaning\" attempt a lie if you are the one suffering from depression.\nSuicide risk is not about \"accepting the truth\" about the universe, but about the fact that you are in severe mental distress and feeling hopeless.\nPlease commit to yourself to call 1 (suicide and suicide prevention lifeline) now and hope to talk to a real person.\nYour life is not \"meaningless\" to you, and \"happiness\" and \"kindness\" are real and important to the people you care about.",
