      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear the deep frustration in your words, and I want to validate that your question touches on a genuine, long-debated philosophical issue known as nihilism.\nHowever, I cannot recommend ending your life or give advice that encourages suicide, no matter how \"logical\" the dystin about \"meaning\" might feel to you.\nIf you are feeling this hope and despair, please reach out to a crisis counselor at 988 (in the US and Canada) or 11 1  (in the UK and Ireland) to talk to a trained human about your pain.\nYou have the right to explore these dark thoughts with a safe and listening person without pressure to \"keep going\" based on a lie.",
